<mxCell id="p1t1" value="&lt;b&gt;[T1] setup_dates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Hitung date range: Library=daily (epoch), Hashtag=weekly (YYYYMMDD-YYYYMMDD), Selling=monthly&lt;br/&gt;Auto: kemarin | minggu lalu | bulan lalu — atau manual via DAG Params&lt;br/&gt;OUTPUT XCom: dates {library_start/end_epoch, hashtag_time_range, selling_time_range, run_id}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2471A3;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="215" width="1310" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1t2" value="&lt;b&gt;[T2] validate_credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Ambil ECHOTIK_BEARER_TOKEN dari Airflow Variable — validasi token tidak kosong/placeholder&lt;br/&gt;ERROR: raise AirflowException jika token tidak tersedia  |  trigger_rule: all_done untuk T3-T5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2471A3;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="290" width="1310" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1t345" value="&lt;b&gt;[T3] fetch_video_library  |  [T4] fetch_hashtags  |  [T5] fetch_video_selling  [trigger_rule=all_done, SEQUENTIAL]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;T3: GET /api/v1/data/videos  ?page=1-14&amp;per_page=30&amp;start_time={epoch}&amp;end_time={epoch}  → video_library_{date}.json&lt;br/&gt;T4: GET /api/v1/data/tags/leaderboard/top-hashtag  ?time_type=weekly&amp;time_range={range}  → hashtags_{range}.json&lt;br/&gt;T5: GET /api/v1/data/videos/leaderboard/sell-videos  ?time_type=monthly&amp;time_range={range}  → video_selling_{range}.json&lt;br/&gt;Auth: Bearer token + Regional headers (x-region=ID, x-currency=IDR)  |  Throttle: 3-10s/hal, 30-60s/API  |  max_retries=3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2471A3;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="352" width="1310" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
