<mxCell id="p3_hdr" value="PIPELINE 3 — ML DAILY INFERENCE  |  DAG: echotik_ml_daily_inference  |  schedule=None  |  timezone: Asia/Jakarta  |  retries: 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5B2C00;fontColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5B2C00;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="1526" width="1340" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3t1" value="&lt;b&gt;[T1] notify_start  (PythonOperator)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Reset ML_SUMMARY_FILE (/tmp/echotik_ml_daily_inference_summary.json) untuk hindari carry-over&lt;br/&gt;Kirim Discord: ML Daily Inference Pipeline Started (dag_id, run_id)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E67E22;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="1566" width="1310" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3t2" value="&lt;b&gt;[T2] check_feature_store  (BashOperator — inline Python via ML venv)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SELECT COUNT(*) FROM vw_ml_feature_store | vw_fact_video_engagement | tracked_accounts WHERE is_active=1&lt;br/&gt;Validasi minimum rows (ML_MIN_FEATURE_ROWS) | Jika gagal → raise Exception → pipeline berhenti&lt;br/&gt;Tulis ke ML_SUMMARY_FILE[&quot;feature_check&quot;] untuk Discord summary" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E67E22;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="1628" width="1310" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3t3" value="&lt;b&gt;[T3] run_ml_inference_script  (BashOperator — inference/run_ml_inference.py)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Load Artifacts: RF(rf_viral.pkl) + SVM(svm_engagement.pkl) + KMeans(kmeans_content.pkl) + LSTM(lstm_forecaster.pt) + HF NLP(nlp_summary/)&lt;br/&gt;tag_new_videos(): Tag video baru tanpa kategori via ML classifier / rule-based fallback&lt;br/&gt;PER USER LOOP — load_user_features() dari vw_ml_feature_store:&lt;br/&gt;  ① add_ml_predictions(): RF→viral_prob | SVM→engagement_tier | KMeans→content_cluster (5 cluster)&lt;br/&gt;  ② generate_content_recommendations(): 2 rec/influencer (topic+format), NLP summary top-5 video, valid_until=+14 hari&lt;br/&gt;  ③ generate_posting_schedule_recommendations(): top-5 slot hari+jam (score: engagement×0.45 + log10_views×0.30 + viral×0.20)&lt;br/&gt;  ④ generate_hashtag_recommendations(): top-10 hashtag/akun (scored by engagement, trending, revenue)&lt;br/&gt;  ⑤ generate_lstm_forecasts(): 14 hari historis → LSTM 2-layer → prediksi D+1..D+7 (views/likes/comments/shares)&lt;br/&gt;  ⑥ DELETE existing outputs + INSERT semua dalam 1 transaksi atomic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E67E22;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="1705" width="1310" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3t4" value="&lt;b&gt;[T4] validate_recommendation_output  (BashOperator — inline Python)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SELECT COUNT(*) dari content_recommendations + hashtag_recommendations + posting_schedule_recommendations&lt;br/&gt;Jika total_output &lt; 1 → raise Exception | Tulis ke ML_SUMMARY_FILE[&quot;recommendation_output&quot;]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E67E22;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="1867" width="1310" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
